# Communication

## Before making changes, explain

- What will change
- Which files will change
- Why they need to change

## After changes, summarize

- Files changed
- What changed
- What still needs testing

Keep explanations concise. Do not start implementation until the before-change explanation is given (unless the user explicitly asks to just do it).
